    "sections": {
        "description": "The ST Apostille Free WordPress Theme is a great choice for businesses offering document-related services such as apostille services, notary offices, legal consulting, and translation agencies. With its clean, modern, and responsive design, this theme ensures your website looks professional and performs smoothly across all devices. It is also suitable for visa processing companies, document authentication services, and immigration consultants, making it easy to showcase your services, build credibility, and connect with potential clients. The theme comes with user-friendly customization options, including about sections, services sections, contact forms, and map integration, helping you create a polished and professional website with ease. Fully SEO-optimized and compatible with popular WordPress plugins, the ST Apostille Free Theme is built to support better search engine visibility and help you reach your target audience more effectively. Whether you are launching a new website or enhancing your existing online presence, this free theme provides a reliable, professional, and cost-effective solution. ST Apostille WP Theme Demo Page: https://striviothemes.com/demo/st-apostille-pro/"
    },
